{"availability":"available","full":"hossimo/CloudDirStat","name":"CloudDirStat","description":"Windirstat for Cloud Storage","category":"Other","language":"Rust","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-29T16:54:28Z","updated":"2026-10-08T04:32:31Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://developers.google.com/oauthplayground","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:07.022Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:07.022Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:07.022Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:35:07.022Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["CloudDirStat is like the amazing WinDirStat (not affiliated) for cloud storage. See what is using the space, and the money, in your Amazon S3, Google Cloud Storage, and Azure Blob Storage buckets.","CloudDirStat lists a bucket (or all of them), rebuilds the folder tree from the object names, and shows it as a sortable folder list and a treemap. Every folder and file shows its size and an estimated monthly cost. It breaks usage down by storage class, file type, and version, and finds storage that costs money but hides from normal listings: old versions, deleted files that are still billed, and abandoned uploads.","The project is in early development. If a scan fails or shows wrong numbers, please open an issue."],"features":["Folder list and treemap, sorted by size, with share of the parent folder, cost per month, object count, and last modified date.","Largest files list, per bucket when scanning several.","Color and filter by storage class, version state, top-level folder, or file type.","Monthly cost estimates from each bucket's own regional list prices.","Hidden costs: old versions, deleted files whose old versions are still billed, and incomplete multipart uploads (S3)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e7275a128a597bd4f9c92540bc953ed943e6127817ed4da4eb9d673ddfec39fb","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:07.355Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:35:07.355Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"CloudDirStat is like the amazing WinDirStat (not affiliated) for cloud storage. See what is using the space, and the money, in your Amazon S3, Google Cloud Storage, and Azure Blob Storage buckets.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"Contents: Features · Install · Quick start · Sign in and permissions · Using the app · Command line · Costs · Troubleshooting · Roadmap · About · Contributing","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Contents: Features · Install · Quick start · Sign in and permissions · Using the app · Command line · Costs · Troubleshooting · Roadmap · About · Contributing","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Each cloud's permissions are listed under Sign in and permissions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"In the app, the sign-in choices to the right of Location change with the cloud you choose: Profile / Access key for s3://, Google login / Access token for gs://, and Azure CLI / SAS token / Account key for az://.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"It needs the cloudwatch:GetMetricData permission and costs about US$0.0003 per bucket.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"Run gcloud auth application-default login, or use an access token.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/hossimo/CloudDirStat/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"e7275a128a597bd